build/bin
node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/dist-web
# Entirely generated by `wails generate module` (which `wails build`
# runs for you). Nothing here is tracked: tsc resolves @wails/* through
# the tsconfig paths that point at src/platform/*.web, and vite aliases
# them per mode, so a fresh clone type-checks and builds without this
# directory existing at all.
frontend/wailsjs/
# wails frontend-deps cache marker
frontend/package.json.md5
# tsc --build incremental state. tsconfig.node.json sets composite:true,
# so any `tsc --build` (or a type-aware lint run, which builds the
# referenced projects) drops one of these next to the config.
frontend/*.tsbuildinfo
# go build output when invoked from desktop/
/desktop
